# photo drop folder — originals never enter version control
/photos-inbox

# Source material from SIWS — 1.1 GB of camera originals, Word documents and
# video. The photographs enter the site through `photos:import`, which writes
# web-sized derivatives into /media; the originals stay on the machine that
# received them. Committing them would put a gigabyte of binaries into every
# clone for no benefit.
/SIWS Content

# A personal copy of the SRS. The current spec is committed; this is not.
SIWS_School_Website_SRS_v2_ORIGINAL_backup.pdf
